                                                                                
 Usage: opentide migrate vocab-scope [OPTIONS]                                  
                                                                                
 Re-prefix stage-scoped vocabulary values (`Process` -> `Host::Process`).       
                                                                                
 Applies only mechanical outcomes: a key defined under exactly one stage,       
 and a stage whose casing drifted. A key defined under several stages is        
 reported, never guessed. Exits 2 when anything is left for a human.            
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --apply               Rewrite the objects (default: dry-run report)          │
│ --field        <str>  Limit to one scoped field (repeatable). Default: every │
│                       scoped field.                                          │
│ --force               Exit 0 even when values need a human decision          │
│ --help                Show this message and exit.                            │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide migrate vocab-scope
   $ opentide migrate vocab-scope --apply
